    "Hide details": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "收起详情"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hides filler words, stutters and repeats when you read, copy or share a transcript. The original text is kept; switch between Clean and Original above a transcript.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "阅读、拷贝、分享转写时去掉语气词、口吃和重复。原文照常保留，转写上方可以在「干净」和「原文」之间切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlights": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In transcripts, %@ marks a sentence that sounds like you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转写里带 %@ 的句子听起来是你说的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Internet services must use https://. Plain http:// only works on your local network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "互联网上的服务必须用 https://；http:// 只能用于局域网。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It connects by itself when it's out of its case and near this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从充电盒里拿出来、在这台 iPhone 附近时会自己连上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It needs long Heart mode recordings from two different days, with the Heart bean clipped on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要两天里各有一段较长的心力模式录音，而且心力豆别在身上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its audio was already removed under Heart mode's audio retention; this deletes the transcript, summary and to-dos left on this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它的音频已按心力模式的音频保留设置删掉；这会删除这台 iPhone 上剩下的转写、摘要和待办。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Joining the Heart bean's Wi‑Fi…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在加入心力豆的 Wi‑Fi…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Joining the recorder's Wi‑Fi…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
