    "My voice": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我的声音"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Names, product names and jargon. OpenBean changes same-sounding words in transcripts to these, without an LLM; in long transcripts only terms of three or more characters are fixed by sound. For a word it keeps mishearing, add what it hears, for example Claude Code heard as “cloud code”. Summaries also get the list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "人名、产品名、行话。OpenBean 不用大模型，把转写里同音写错的词改成这里的写法；长篇转写里只有三个字以上的词条按读音纠正。总被听错的词，把它听成的写法加上，例如 Claude Code 听成「cloud code」。写摘要时也会用到这份词表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs the voice model (28 MB).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要声纹模型（28 MB）。"
          }
