    "Only Heart mode recordings that are transcribed lose their audio; transcripts, summaries and marks stay. Normal recordings always keep their audio. Change the rule in Heart mode settings. OpenBean also applies it on its own every hour.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只删已转写的心力模式录音的音频；转写、摘要和重点标记都留着。普通录音一直保留音频。规则在心力模式设置里改。OpenBean 每小时也会自动按规则清理一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open OpenBean with the Heart bean nearby to finish syncing. What's already received is kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
