    },
    "The connection dropped. Sync continues when the recorder reconnects.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接断了。录音豆重新连上后会接着同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The diary and conversation summaries are written by the LLM service set in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日记和段摘要由设置里的大模型服务来写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The diary couldn't be written; OpenBean tries again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日记没写成，OpenBean 稍后会再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The diary wasn't written: %@, %lld times. OpenBean won't try again on its own until this day's recordings change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日记没写成：%@，已经 %lld 次。这天的录音有变化之前，OpenBean 不会再自动重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The diary wasn't written: %@. Trying again automatically after %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日记没写成：%@。%@ 之后会自动再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The diary wasn't written: the model service couldn't be reached. It will be tried again after the next sync.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日记没写成：连不上大模型服务。下次同步后会再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key is kept in this iPhone's keychain. Model names change over time; Test connection checks the name with the service.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "密钥存在这台 iPhone 的钥匙串里。模型名会随服务更新而变，「测试连接」会向服务核对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The log is empty.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日志是空的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model's reply could not be used. Try again or use a larger model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型的回复无法使用，请重试或换一个更大的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recorder didn't start its Wi‑Fi. Try again, or keep syncing over Bluetooth.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音豆没有开启 Wi‑Fi。可以再试一次，或继续用蓝牙同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recorder is still busy sending. Sync continues shortly from where it stopped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音豆还在忙着发送，稍后从断开的地方接着同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recorder isn't connected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音豆没连上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server didn't accept the connection. Check the address and port.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器拒绝了连接，请检查地址和端口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The service doesn't know the model “%@”. Check the model name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务不认识模型「%@」，请检查模型名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The service doesn't know the model “%@”. It offers, for example: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务不认识模型「%@」。它提供的模型例如：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The service had an error (HTTP %lld). Try again later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务出错（HTTP %lld），请稍后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The service is limiting requests right now. Try again in a minute.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务现在限制了请求频率，请过一分钟再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The service rejected the API key. Check that it was copied in full.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务拒绝了这个 API 密钥，请检查是否复制完整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The service says the account has no credit or quota left.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务提示账户余额或额度不足。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The service took too long to answer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务太久没有回应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their transcripts and summaries stay on this iPhone. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它们的转写和摘要会留在这台 iPhone 上。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are %lld recordings (%@) on it. Over Bluetooth this takes about %@ and continues in the background. If you choose Not now, automatic sync is turned off; you can turn it on in Settings or sync from the recorder page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上面有 %1$lld 条录音（共 %2$@）。蓝牙传完大约要 %3$@，切到后台也会继续。选「先不同步」会关掉自动同步，之后可以在设置里打开，或在录音豆页手动同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are %lld recordings (%@) on it. Over Bluetooth this takes about %@ and continues in the background. Over Wi‑Fi it takes about %@: your iPhone joins the recorder's own Wi‑Fi meanwhile (iOS asks once), and OpenBean needs to stay open. If you choose Not now, automatic sync is turned off; you can turn it on in Settings or sync from the recorder page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上面有 %1$lld 条录音（共 %2$@）。蓝牙传完大约要 %3$@，切到后台也会继续。用 Wi‑Fi 大约 %4$@：期间 iPhone 会连到录音豆自己的 Wi‑Fi（系统会问一次），OpenBean 要留在前台。选「先不同步」会关掉自动同步，之后可以在设置里打开，或在录音豆页手动同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They sync when the Heart bean goes back in its case.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "心力豆放回充电盒时会同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They sync when the recorder goes back in its case.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音豆放回充电盒时会同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Things": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "事"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This conversation is no longer here": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这段对话已经不在了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This deletes the audio, transcript, summary and to-dos on this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会删除这台 iPhone 上的音频、转写、摘要和待办。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This deletes their audio, transcripts, summaries and to-dos on this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会删除这台 iPhone 上它们的音频、转写、摘要和待办。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone can't use Apple Intelligence, or Apple Intelligence isn't offered in your region. Use a cloud or network service instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 iPhone 不能使用 Apple 智能，或所在地区未提供 Apple 智能。请改用云端或局域网服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone is offline.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 iPhone 没有联网。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is not a valid address. It should start with https:// (or http:// on your local network).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
