      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "昨天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can change these later in Heart mode settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以后可以在心力模式的设置里改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You won't hear when today's record is updated or a sync needs you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今天的记录更新、或同步需要你处理时，你不会收到提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your iPhone joins the Heart bean's own Wi‑Fi for about %@, then goes back to your usual Wi‑Fi. iOS asks once to join the network. Meanwhile there's no internet over Wi‑Fi; mobile data may take over. Keep OpenBean open: if you leave it, what was received is kept and Bluetooth continues from there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 会连到心力豆自己的 Wi‑Fi 约 %@，之后回到你原来的 Wi‑Fi。系统会问一次是否加入这个网络。这期间 Wi‑Fi 上没有互联网，可能改走蜂窝数据。请让 OpenBean 留在前台：离开的话，已收到的部分留着，蓝牙会从那里接着传。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your iPhone joins the recorder's own Wi‑Fi for about %@, then goes back to your usual Wi‑Fi. iOS asks once to join the network. Meanwhile there's no internet over Wi‑Fi; mobile data may take over. Keep OpenBean open: if you leave it, what was received is kept and Bluetooth continues from there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 会连到录音豆自己的 Wi‑Fi 约 %@，之后回到你原来的 Wi‑Fi。系统会问一次是否加入这个网络。这期间 Wi‑Fi 上没有互联网，可能改走蜂窝数据。请让 OpenBean 留在前台：离开的话，已收到的部分留着，蓝牙会从那里接着传。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "about %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "约 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
